[I] Ayatana Indicator for Accessibility Settings

[T] ayatana-indicator-a11y is an Ayatana system indicator providing a panel
[T] menu for quickly toggling accessibility settings such as the on-screen
[T] keyboard, screen reader and high contrast. Ayatana Indicators continue
[T] Canonical's Unity indicators for desktops like MATE.

[U] https://github.com/AyatanaIndicators/ayatana-indicator-a11y

[A] AyatanaIndicators
